{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14706","headline":"感兴 · 崔膺","name":"感兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"富贵难义合，困穷易感恩。\n古来忠烈士，多出贫贱门。\n世上桃李树，但结繁华子。\n白屋抱关人，青云壮心死。\n本以势利交，势尽交情已。\n如何失情後，始叹门易轨。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔膺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14706.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14706","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}